{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>天文台預測，一道冷鋒明日稍後橫過華南沿岸，明晚氣溫顯著下降。</p><p></p><p>本港正受偏東氣流影響，部分時間有陽光，但明日稍後會轉吹偏北風，氣溫開始下降，周四市區最低18度，隨後再有強烈東北季候風。本周後期普遍清涼，內陸地區早晚寒冷。周五氣溫進一步下降至最低15度，周末仍然清涼，下周初氣溫回升。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:25.985670+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:02:31.517466+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:42:34.481860+00:00","content_hash":"61a836b2a49e54ca2e86344216e9c58ec06f595850d7a4a2e700673e3853a558","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:25.985670+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}